        "label": "Where trust changes hands",
        "focus": [
          "model",
          "agents",
          "scope",
          "gate"
        ],
        "note": "Agents emit only text. The frozen scope and the deterministic gate — not the model — decide what runs."
      },
      {
        "id": "escalation",
        "label": "Risk escalation",
        "focus": [
          "gate",
          "approver",
          "audit"
        ],
        "note": "Hard checks can only DENY; a soft risk score can ESCALATE to a human. Every decision is appended to the hash-chained ledger."
      }
